name: sim.resetDistance
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.resetDistance(int distanceObjectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. distanceObjectHandle: handle of the distance object or sim.handle_all or sim.handle_all_except_explicit. (sim.handle_all will reset all registered distance objects, while sim.handle_all_except_explicit will only reset those that are not marked as "explicit handling")
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
